(text "BM83 PROGRAMMER - REV C / ONE PCB" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "42e7f661-265c-4d7a-9e5b-0525721d8b1d"))
(text "J1 CABLE / Adafruit 954\n1 RED +5V power; 2 BLACK ground\n3 GREEN adapter TX -> BM83 RX29\n4 WHITE adapter RX <- BM83 TX30\n3.3V UART logic. No 5V signal drive." (at 20.32 120.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c97a6110-da55-4229-a62d-4e9b1b86ef61"))
(text "J1 pin1 directly supplies ADAP_IN. JP2: Test mode.\nSW1 grounds RESET_N; internal pull-up.\nC2 is BAT_IN bypass ONLY; never connect USB 5V to BAT_IN.\nSYS_PWR, VDD_IO and USB D+/D- are not contacted.\nNo J2 / no wiring harness / no separate probe PCB." (at 91.44 120.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4b2e28f0-13ae-4e1a-8ae7-700412a49aca"))
(text "P1-P10 ARE DIRECT PCB-MOUNTED PROBES\nElectrical terminal: 0.30mm solder tail -> 0.45mm plated hole.\nCopper pad 0.80mm; 1.00mm adjacent contact pitch.\nPrinted locator supports 0.70mm barrels at their 0.80mm collars.\nNominal collar Z10.20; free tip Z20.50; module underside Z17.50.\n3.00mm working compression. Check actual fit/heights before use.\nNo solder on BM83. Do not solder probe barrel or upper plunger." (at 172.72 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d7b6490-cf34-4d56-8b52-f0d73e5a6c7d"))
(text "PIN / PROGRAMMING REFERENCES - Microchip DS70005402H\nTable 2-2 pp13-15: pin identities. Fig 8-1 p56 / Fig 8-2 p57: pad regions.\nSec 6.3.1 / Table 6-1 p44: ADAP_IN 5V + P3_4 LOW during start/reset.\nSec 6.4 notes 2-3 p46: P3_4 boot selection; P8_5/P8_6 reserved for Flash download.\nSec 6.2 p43: RESET_N internal pull-up. Tables 9-2/9-3 p58: voltages.\nProgramming map is independent of normal application GPIO assignments.\nActual module firmware/configuration has not been read from hardware." (at 20.32 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c012d847-7d60-4157-bbd0-c178bbd1cebc"))
(text "PROBE / TOOL REFERENCES\nINGUN GKS-080-0001 drawing p1: 0.30mm lower terminal, 3mm long;\n0.70mm barrel / 0.80mm collar / 0.35mm tip / 22.30mm overall.\nDS50002902B Sec 5.1 / Table 5-1 p20: UART update / isUpdate 115200.\nFixture is custom; PCB hole/pad sizes are designed here, not a factory footprint.\nUnplug USB before module insertion/removal or changing JP2.\nPrototype requires alignment, continuity and verified write tests." (at 172.72 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e656a0a5-0e4a-48b5-9827-e34c0bc9bac7"))
)
